         "text": "Substitute \\( u = 2x^{2} \\), raising the whole of \\( 2x^{2} \\) to each power: the series begins \\( 1 + 2x^{2} + 4x^{4} + 8x^{6} + \\cdots \\).",
         "mathjson": [
